      },
      {
        "text": "The legacy concept 'Revenues' is present for every fiscal year/period in Tesla's filings, as shown by non‑zero counts in E-01109d for all years.",
        "evidence": ["E-01109d"]
      }
    ],
    "inferences": [
      {
        "text": "The coexistence of both concepts reflects the SEC's taxonomy update to capture ASC 606 requirements, not duplicate reporting or errors.",
